@startuml SolanaRandomContractClient
!include ../style.puml
!include ../interfaces/IRandomContract.puml

title SolanaRandomContractClient Class

class SolanaRandomContractClient {
    - connection: Connection
    - programId: PublicKey
    - wallet: Wallet
    --
    + commit(commitParams: CommitParams)
    + reveal(secretParams: ISecretParams)
    + requestEntropy(requestParams: EntropyRequest): requestId
    + statusEntropy(): EntropyStatus
    --
    - sendTransaction(instruction: TransactionInstruction): signature
    - getAccountInfo(address: PublicKey): AccountInfo
    - buildInstruction(method: string, data: Buffer): TransactionInstruction
}

SolanaRandomContractClient ..|> RandomContract

note right of SolanaRandomContractClient
  **Solana Implementation**
  
  Implements RandomContract interface
  for Solana blockchain using
  @solana/web3.js client pattern.
end note

@enduml